{
  "openapi": "3.1.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "Heartbeat API",
    "description": "Heartbeat HTTP 接口契约。维护者直接修改此文件。文档站读取此文件展示接口，后端按契约实现。",
    "version": "draft"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/api"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/entities/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "读取实体",
        "description": "按 UUIDv7 查询统一索引，读取实体。后端通过统一索引定位业务实体所属 Schema 的业务表。\n\n所有类别使用同一响应结构：\n\n- `category`：模型类别。实体定义的类别为 `entity_schema`。\n- `references`：具名实体引用。键是业务定义的引用名称，非空值是目标 UUIDv7。字段定义允许空值时可以为 `null`。没有引用字段时为 `{}`。\n- `properties`：其他业务属性，不重复引用字段。\n\n实体 `id` 由请求路径提供。内容中的标识字符串不自动成为引用。后端将已知时间统一返回为 UTC。",
        "operationId": "getEntity",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "实体的 UUIDv7。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000003"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "entity": {
                    "summary": "通用实体",
                    "value": {
                      "category": "entity",
                      "references": {
                        "relatedEntityId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
                      },
                      "properties": {
                        "name": "示例实体"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "observer": {
                    "summary": "观测主体",
                    "value": {
                      "category": "observer",
                      "references": {},
                      "properties": {
                        "name": "示例观测主体"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "observation": {
                    "summary": "观测",
                    "value": {
                      "category": "observation",
                      "references": {
                        "observerId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000002",
                        "contentId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000003",
                        "schemaId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000004"
                      },
                      "properties": {
                        "startAt": "2026-10-06T01:00:00Z",
                        "endAt": "2026-10-06T01:30:00Z",
                        "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "entitySchema": {
                    "summary": "实体定义",
                    "value": {
                      "category": "entity_schema",
                      "references": {},
                      "properties": {
                        "name": "示例记录",
                        "resourceName": "example-records",
                        "fields": {
                          "title": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "required": true,
                            "nullable": true
                          },
                          "relatedEntityId": {
                            "type": "reference",
                            "required": true,
                            "nullable": false
                          },
                          "identifiers": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "required": true,
                            "nullable": false,
                            "items": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "nullable": false,
                              "fields": {
                                "scheme": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "required": true,
                                  "nullable": false
                                },
                                "value": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "required": true,
                                  "nullable": false
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not Found",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/entities/observers/{id}": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "保存观测主体",
        "description": "路径中的 UUIDv7 提供实体标识。保存路径声明模型类别。请求体外层只能包含 `references` 和 `properties`，且两者必须出现。\n\nObserver 没有实体引用，`references` 必须为 `{}`。`properties` 保存其他业务属性，不重复引用字段。\n\n保存行为：\n\n- 首次保存时，后端创建实体。\n- 如果已有实体的 ID 和类别与合法请求一致，后端替换内容。\n- 如果类别不一致，后端返回 `409` 并保留原内容。\n- 重复提交相同请求时，后端不新增实体。",
        "operationId": "saveObserver",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "实体的 UUIDv7。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000002"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Observer"
              },
              "examples": {
                "example": {
                  "summary": "没有引用的观测主体",
                  "value": {
                    "references": {},
                    "properties": {
                      "name": "前台状态 Observer"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "No Content"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求不符合契约。例如：标识或 JSON 无效、缺少必填字段、包含额外根字段，或 `references` 与 `properties` 包含同名字段。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Conflict",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Payload Too Large",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/entities/observations/{id}": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "保存观测",
        "description": "路径中的 UUIDv7 提供实体标识。保存路径声明模型类别。请求体外层只能包含 `references` 和 `properties`，且两者必须出现。\n\n请求字段：\n\n- `references`：以引用名称映射目标 UUIDv7，包含 `observerId`、`contentId` 和 `schemaId`。\n- `properties`：保存时间边界和事实时区，不重复引用字段。未知值必须为 `null`。\n\n保存行为：\n\n- 首次保存时，后端创建实体。\n- 如果已有实体的 ID 和类别与合法请求一致，后端替换内容。\n- 如果类别不一致，后端返回 `409` 并保留原内容。\n- 重复提交相同请求时，后端不新增实体。",
        "operationId": "saveObservation",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "实体的 UUIDv7。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000005"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Observation"
              },
              "examples": {
                "example": {
                  "summary": "观测引用主体、内容和定义",
                  "value": {
                    "references": {
                      "observerId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000002",
                      "contentId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000003",
                      "schemaId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000004"
                    },
                    "properties": {
                      "startAt": "2026-10-06T09:00:00+08:00",
                      "endAt": "2026-10-06T09:30:00+08:00",
                      "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "unknownTime": {
                  "summary": "时间和事实时区未知",
                  "value": {
                    "references": {
                      "observerId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000002",
                      "contentId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000003",
                      "schemaId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000004"
                    },
                    "properties": {
                      "startAt": null,
                      "endAt": null,
                      "timeZone": null
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "No Content"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求不符合契约。例如：标识或 JSON 无效、缺少必填字段、包含额外根字段，或 `references` 与 `properties` 包含同名字段。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Conflict",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Payload Too Large",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/entities/schemas/{id}": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "保存实体定义",
        "description": "路径中的 UUIDv7 是 EntitySchema 的标识。保存路径声明实体定义类别。请求体由 `references` 和 `properties` 组成。\n\n模型声明：\n\n- `properties.name`：供人阅读的定义名称。\n- `properties.resourceName`：业务资源名，登记 `PUT /entities/{resourceName}/{id}` 入口。资源名只使用小写英文字母、数字和连字符，以字母开头，例如 `local-applications`。资源名全局唯一，不能使用 `schemas`、`observers`、`observations`。插件可以自行加前缀，例如 `acme-local-applications`；系统不另设命名空间。`name` 可以使用中文。后端根据资源名生成默认业务表名，规则见[业务表命名](/storage#业务表命名)。\n- `properties.fields`：业务实体的字段定义。键是字段名，值是字段定义。每个字段通过 `type` 声明类型。\n\n顶层业务字段不能使用 `id` 或 `__omitted_fields`；前者保存实体自身标识，后者由后端记录省略的字段。后端将普通属性和引用字段名转换为 `snake_case`，作为默认列名。登记时，如果不同字段转换后重名、占用系统列或数据库内置列，或列名超过数据库长度限制，后端拒绝登记，不自动改名。对象和数组各占一个 JSON 列。规则见[业务列命名](/storage#业务列命名)。\n\n普通属性和实体引用都在 `fields` 中定义。`type: \"reference\"` 声明实体引用：业务实体提交和读取时，这个字段的值放在 `references` 中。普通属性值放在 `properties` 中。同一字段的值只出现一次。\n\n引用位置：\n\n`reference` 只允许出现在 EntitySchema 的顶层字段。对象成员和数组元素不允许使用 `reference`，这一规则适用于任意嵌套层级。`references` 保持“引用名称 → 目标实体标识”的结构。对象和数组内部的普通标识字符串不自动成为实体引用。\n\n字段类型：\n\n| `type` | 值的含义 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `string` | 字符串，例如 `\"示例标题\"` |\n| `boolean` | 布尔值，例如 `true` |\n| `integer` | 整数，例如 `12` |\n| `number` | 数值，例如 `12.5` |\n| `reference` | 目标实体的 UUIDv7 |\n| `object` | JSON 对象 |\n| `array` | JSON 数组 |\n\n`type` 只能使用上述取值。是否允许 `null` 由 `nullable` 声明。对象成员和数组元素按模型声明校验。对象字段的存储方式不改变 HTTP 中的业务对象结构。对象和数组整体保存，读取时按原结构返回。数据库列映射见[存储文档](/storage#业务字段映射)。\n\n对象成员：\n\n`type: \"object\"` 通过 `fields` 声明成员。键是成员名，值是成员的字段定义。每个成员继续明确提供 `type`、`required` 和 `nullable`。`fields` 描述业务结构，对象整体保存在 JSON 列中。\n\n数组元素：\n\n`type: \"array\"` 通过 `items` 定义每个元素。`items` 必须明确提供 `type` 和 `nullable`，不使用 `required`。数组字段的 `required` 决定字段是否必须出现，字段的 `nullable` 决定数组本身能否为 `null`，`items.nullable` 决定元素能否为 `null`。字段必填不表示数组至少包含一个元素。对象元素通过 `items.fields` 声明成员，每个成员继续使用完整字段定义。\n\n每个字段必须明确提供 `type`、`required` 和 `nullable`。缺少任一配置时，请求不合法。三项配置没有隐含默认值。字段定义只接受已声明的配置，`fields` 仅用于 `object`，`items` 仅用于 `array`。\n\n字段约束：\n\n- `required`：是否必须提交这个字段。\n- `nullable`：字段出现时是否允许值为 `null`。\n\n两项约束分别判断。示例中的 `title` 使用 `required: true` 和 `nullable: true`，因此 `\"title\": null` 合法，省略 `title` 不合法。`relatedEntityId` 使用 `required: true` 和 `nullable: false`，因此必须提供目标实体的 UUIDv7。\n\nEntitySchema 请求外层的 `references` 表示定义实体自身的引用；`fields` 中的引用字段声明业务实体将具有哪些引用，两者用途不同。\n\n独立业务实体和观测内容都可以使用 EntitySchema。每个业务 SchemaId 对应一张业务表。后端根据模型声明建表、校验和还原实体。\n\n保存与更新：\n\n- 首次保存时，后端检查生成的业务表名长度与重名，保存实体定义、登记资源名与 SchemaId 的绑定，并创建对应业务表。三项操作全部成功后，业务保存入口可用。\n- 如果任一步骤失败，后端回滚本次操作，不留下部分定义、资源绑定或新业务表。已有内容保持不变。\n- 重复提交相同请求时，后端不新增定义。\n- 同一 ID 的模型结构、约束和业务含义必须保持不变。修改已登记的 `fields` 返回 `409`，保留原定义、资源绑定和业务表。对象键顺序不影响比较。如果模型变化，创建方必须使用新 ID。\n- 同一 SchemaId 的 `resourceName` 在首次登记后固定，后续提交必须保持原值。尝试修改已登记的资源名时，后端返回 `409 Conflict`，并保留原定义与资源绑定。\n- 如果仅修改显示名称 `name`，且模型含义不变，可以沿用原 ID。显示名称的修改不改变资源名或接口地址。\n- 如果类别冲突，或资源名已被其他 SchemaId 占用，后端返回 `409` 并保留原内容。",
        "operationId": "saveEntitySchema",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "实体的 UUIDv7。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000004"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntitySchema"
              },
              "examples": {
                "example": {
                  "summary": "定义带有标题、实体引用和对象数组的业务实体",
                  "value": {
                    "references": {},
                    "properties": {
                      "name": "示例记录",
                      "resourceName": "example-records",
                      "fields": {
                        "title": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "required": true,
                          "nullable": true
                        },
                        "relatedEntityId": {
                          "type": "reference",
                          "required": true,
                          "nullable": false
                        },
                        "identifiers": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "required": true,
                          "nullable": false,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "nullable": false,
                            "fields": {
                              "scheme": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "required": true,
                                "nullable": false
                              },
                              "value": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "required": true,
                                "nullable": false
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "实体定义、资源绑定与业务表创建成功。无响应体。"
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "合法更新或重复提交成功。重复提交不新增定义、资源绑定或业务表。无响应体。"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求不符合契约。例如：标识或 JSON 无效、缺少必填字段、包含额外根字段，或 `references` 与 `properties` 包含同名字段。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "实体类别冲突、资源名已被其他 SchemaId 占用，或尝试修改当前 SchemaId 已登记的资源名。保留原定义与资源绑定。 已登记的 fields 被修改。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "resourceNameChange": {
                    "summary": "修改已登记的资源名",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "about:blank",
                      "title": "Conflict",
                      "status": 409,
                      "detail": "同一 SchemaId 的 resourceName 在首次登记后固定，不能修改。"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Payload Too Large",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "后端因未预期错误而保存失败。本次定义保存、资源登记和首次建表一起回滚。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/entities/{resourceName}/{id}": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "保存业务实体",
        "description": "按已登记的业务资源名保存实体。路径中的 `resourceName` 绑定一个 SchemaId，`id` 是业务实体的 UUIDv7。\n\n请求体只包含 `references` 与 `properties`，且两者必须出现。引用字段放入 `references`，普通属性放入 `properties`。实体自身标识由路径提供，字段值不重复。\n\n字段是否必须出现、是否允许为 `null`，由 EntitySchema 的 `required` 和 `nullable` 分别约束。后端保存并还原字段省略与显式 `null` 的区别。保存已有实体时按完整替换处理，省略字段不保留旧值。`__omitted_fields` 由后端维护，提交方不提供这个系统列，响应也不包含它。存储规则见[字段省略与空值](/storage#字段省略与空值)。\n\n保存流程：\n\n1. 根据资源名找到 EntitySchema。资源名未登记时，后端返回 `404 Not Found`，不创建实体内容、统一实体索引或业务表。\n2. 按定义校验字段、类型、引用和约束。未声明字段返回 `400`，包括嵌套对象成员。非空引用只校验 UUIDv7 格式，允许目标尚未入库，不限制目标模型。\n3. 根据存储映射找到业务表。\n4. 在同一事务中保存实体内容和统一实体索引。\n\n首次保存返回 `201`。保存已有实体时，实体必须属于路径绑定的 Schema；合法替换或重复提交返回 `204`。如果实体类别或所属 Schema 冲突，返回 `409` 并保留原内容。\n\n资源名在[保存实体定义](/api/saveEntitySchema)时登记。后端使用公共保存逻辑处理已登记资源。读取继续使用 `GET /entities/{id}`，响应类别为 `entity`。",
        "operationId": "saveBusinessEntity",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "resourceName",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "已登记的业务资源名。后端据此找到 EntitySchema 和业务表。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityResourceName"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "实体的 UUIDv7。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000005"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BusinessEntity"
              },
              "examples": {
                "example": {
                  "summary": "符合示例记录定义的业务实体",
                  "value": {
                    "references": {
                      "relatedEntityId": "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
                    },
                    "properties": {
                      "title": "示例标题",
                      "identifiers": [
                        {
                          "scheme": "example.identifier",
                          "value": "example-value"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "No Content"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求不符合契约。例如：标识或 JSON 无效、缺少必填字段、包含额外根字段，或 `references` 与 `properties` 包含同名字段。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "业务资源名未登记。不创建实体内容、统一实体索引或业务表。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unregisteredResource": {
                    "summary": "业务资源名未登记",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "about:blank",
                      "title": "Not Found",
                      "status": 404,
                      "detail": "业务资源名 example-records 未登记。请先保存对应的 EntitySchema。"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "实体类别或所属 Schema 与路径绑定的模型冲突。保留原内容。",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Payload Too Large",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProblemDetails"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "EntityResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "category",
          "references",
          "properties"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "entity",
              "observation",
              "observer",
              "entity_schema"
            ],
            "description": "实体的模型类别。所有类别使用同一响应结构。"
          },
          "references": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "实体引用。键是业务定义的引用名称，非空值是目标实体的 UUIDv7。字段定义允许空值时可以为 null。没有引用字段时为 {}。引用字段只放在 references 中。",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "const": "__omitted_fields"
              }
            }
          },
          "properties": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "其他业务属性，不重复引用字段。保存契约与业务定义说明字段含义。已知时间以 UTC 表示。",
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id",
                  "__omitted_fields"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "统一实体读取响应。category 声明模型类别，references 保存具名引用，properties 保存其他业务属性。实体 id 由请求路径提供。 读取保留字段省略与显式 null 的区别。省略的业务字段不出现在响应中；已提交的 null 按 null 返回。__omitted_fields 是后端维护的存储系统列，不出现在业务请求或响应中。",
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "Observation": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "references",
          "properties"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "references": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "observerId",
              "contentId",
              "schemaId"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "observerId": {
                "examples": [
                  "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
                ],
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
                "type": "string",
                "description": "形成本次观测的 Observer 的 UUIDv7。",
                "format": "uuid"
              },
              "contentId": {
                "examples": [
                  "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
                ],
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
                "type": "string",
                "description": "本次观测引用的观测内容实体的 UUIDv7。",
                "format": "uuid"
              },
              "schemaId": {
                "examples": [
                  "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
                ],
                "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
                "type": "string",
                "description": "观测内容所遵循的 EntitySchema 的 UUIDv7。EntitySchema 说明内容的结构、事实含义和时间含义。",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "观测引用的观测主体、观测内容和实体定义。目标可以尚未入库。"
          },
          "properties": {
            "required": [
              "startAt",
              "endAt",
              "timeZone"
            ],
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "startAt": {
                "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(?:\\.[0-9]+)?(?:Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$",
                "type": [
                  "null",
                  "string"
                ],
                "description": "事实开始时间。如果时间已知，值必须包含 Z 或明确 UTC 偏移。如果时间未知，值必须为 null。",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "endAt": {
                "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(?:\\.[0-9]+)?(?:Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$",
                "type": [
                  "null",
                  "string"
                ],
                "description": "事实结束时间。如果时间未知，值必须为 null。起止边界相等表示时间点。开始早于结束表示左闭右开区间。",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "timeZone": {
                "type": [
                  "null",
                  "string"
                ],
                "description": "事实所属的 IANA 时区 ID，例如 Asia/Shanghai。如果时区未知，值必须为 null。前端按浏览器或系统时区显示时间。"
              }
            },
            "description": "事实时间和事实时区。未知值必须为 null。如果起止时间均已知，开始时刻必须早于或等于结束时刻。",
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id",
                  "observerId",
                  "contentId",
                  "schemaId"
                ]
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "description": "观测的保存请求。references 保存三个实体引用，properties 保存时间边界和事实时区。引用字段不得在 properties 中重复。",
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "EntitySchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "references",
          "properties"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "references": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "此模型没有实体引用。references 必须为 {}。",
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "properties": {
            "required": [
              "name",
              "resourceName",
              "fields"
            ],
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "实体定义的名称。"
              },
              "resourceName": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityResourceName"
              },
              "fields": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "业务实体的字段定义。键是业务字段名，值是字段定义。普通属性和实体引用统一在此声明，通过 type 区分。type 为 reference 的字段值放在业务实体的 references 中，普通属性值放在 properties 中。 reference 只允许用于此处的顶层字段，对象成员和数组元素不允许使用 reference。 顶层业务字段不能使用 id 或 __omitted_fields，这两个名称留给存储系统列。",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityFieldDefinition"
                },
                "propertyNames": {
                  "not": {
                    "enum": [
                      "id",
                      "__omitted_fields"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "实体定义声明显示名称、业务资源名和字段。同一 ID 的模型结构、约束和业务含义固定。",
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id",
                  "schema"
                ]
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "description": "实体定义的保存请求。properties.name 保存显示名称，properties.resourceName 登记业务保存入口，properties.fields 保存字段定义。定义保存、资源登记和首次建表全部成功后才返回成功。 同一 SchemaId 的 resourceName 在首次登记后固定，后续提交必须保持原值。修改显示名称 name 不改变资源名或接口地址。 修改已登记的 fields 返回 409；对象键顺序不影响定义比较。字段定义只允许已声明的配置：fields 仅用于 object，items 仅用于 array。",
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "Observer": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "references",
          "properties"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "references": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "此模型没有实体引用。references 必须为 {}。",
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "properties": {
            "required": [
              "name"
            ],
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "观测主体的名称。"
              }
            },
            "description": "观测主体的其他属性。",
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id"
                ]
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "description": "观测主体的保存请求。references 必须为 {}。properties 保存名称。",
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "ProblemDetails": {
        "required": [
          "type",
          "title",
          "status",
          "detail"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "const": "about:blank",
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri-reference"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "EntityFieldDefinition": {
        "description": "字段定义。必须明确提供 type、required 和 nullable。required 约束字段是否必须出现，nullable 约束字段值是否允许为空。",
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityValueDefinition"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "required"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "required": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "是否必须提交这个业务字段。true 表示字段必须出现；false 表示允许省略。"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "unevaluatedProperties": false
      },
      "EntityValueDefinition": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "nullable"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "字段类型。string 为字符串，boolean 为布尔值，integer 为整数，number 为数值，reference 为实体引用，object 为对象，array 为数组。reference 的非空值是目标实体的 UUIDv7。空值由 nullable 声明。 reference 只允许用于实体顶层字段。",
            "enum": [
              "string",
              "boolean",
              "integer",
              "number",
              "reference",
              "object",
              "array"
            ]
          },
          "nullable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "值是否允许为 null。true 表示允许 null；false 表示不允许 null。"
          },
          "fields": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "对象成员定义。type 为 object 时必须提供 fields。键是成员名，值是成员的字段定义。每个成员必须明确提供 type、required 和 nullable。 成员不允许使用 reference。",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityNestedFieldDefinition"
            }
          },
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityArrayItemDefinition",
            "description": "数组元素定义。type 为 array 时必须提供 items。每个元素按此定义校验。"
          }
        },
        "description": "值的定义。必须明确提供 type 和 nullable。object 通过 fields 声明成员，array 通过 items 声明元素。",
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "object"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "fields"
              ]
            },
            "else": {
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "fields"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "const": "array"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "items"
              ]
            },
            "else": {
              "not": {
                "required": [
                  "items"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "EntityArrayItemDefinition": {
        "description": "数组元素定义。必须明确提供 type 和 nullable，不使用 required。元素为 object 时通过 fields 定义成员，成员仍使用完整字段定义。 数组元素不允许使用 reference。",
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityValueDefinition"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "required"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "not": {
                  "const": "reference"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "unevaluatedProperties": false
      },
      "EntityNestedFieldDefinition": {
        "description": "对象成员定义。成员必须明确提供 type、required 和 nullable。对象成员不允许使用 reference；实体引用只能声明在实体顶层字段。",
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityFieldDefinition"
          },
          {
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "not": {
                  "const": "reference"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "EntityResourceName": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "description": "业务保存入口的资源名，绑定一个 SchemaId。只使用小写英文字母、数字和连字符，以字母开头。资源名全局唯一，不能使用 schemas、observers 或 observations。插件可以自行加前缀，例如 acme-local-applications；系统不另设命名空间。name 是显示名称，可以使用中文；resourceName 用于接口路径，后端将资源名中的连字符替换为下划线，并加上 entity_ 前缀，生成默认业务表名。 同一 SchemaId 的 resourceName 在首次登记后固定，后续提交必须保持原值。修改显示名称 name 不改变资源名或接口地址。",
        "examples": [
          "example-records",
          "local-applications",
          "foreground-application-periods",
          "acme-local-applications"
        ],
        "pattern": "^(?!(schemas|observers|observations)$)[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(?![\\s\\S])"
      },
      "BusinessEntity": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "references",
          "properties"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "references": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "实体引用。键是业务定义的引用名称，非空值是目标实体的 UUIDv7。字段定义允许空值时可以为 null。没有引用字段时为 {}。引用字段只放在 references 中。",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "examples": [
                "0192b056-7300-7000-8000-000000000001"
              ],
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-7[0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89aAbB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ],
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id",
                  "__omitted_fields"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "properties": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "其他业务属性，不重复引用字段。保存契约与业务定义说明字段含义。已知时间以 UTC 表示。",
            "propertyNames": {
              "not": {
                "enum": [
                  "id",
                  "__omitted_fields"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "业务实体的保存请求。路径中的资源名确定 EntitySchema。后端根据该定义校验字段、类型、引用及约束。实体标识由路径提供。 读取保留字段省略与显式 null 的区别。省略的业务字段不出现在响应中；已提交的 null 按 null 返回。__omitted_fields 是后端维护的存储系统列，不出现在业务请求或响应中。 未声明的字段返回 400，包括嵌套对象的成员。非空引用只校验 UUIDv7 格式，允许目标尚未入库，不限制目标模型。"
      }
    }
  }
}
